# Data

The calibration database is not redistributed with this software release.

The LLX2026 study uses records derived from the Northwestern University
concrete creep and shrinkage database. Redistribution rights and study-level
grouping must be checked independently before depositing those records in a
public GitHub or Zenodo release.

For software testing, use `../examples/batch_input.csv`. It contains only a
small format example and is not an experimental validation dataset.
